# Copy to .env.local (ignored by git) and fill in to see the embedded map in
# `npm run dev`. The deploy reads the same name from the repository secret
# GOOGLE_MAPS_EMBED_KEY. Leave empty and the shelter page falls back to an
# "open in Google Maps" link.
#
# The key ships inside the built page, so restrict it in Google Cloud:
#   Application restriction: Websites
#     https://jen-chieh-yu.github.io/stray-atlas/*
#     http://localhost:5173/*
#   API restriction: Maps Embed API only
VITE_GOOGLE_MAPS_EMBED_KEY=
